A forward lens that computes a value its target field may reject, which no
loading path may admit. Its diagnostics are positioned in the lens, in the
version file that declares it.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	a: int32
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	a: int32 & >=0
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		a: v0_0.a * 2
	}
}

BackwardLens: {
	v1_0: _
	v0_0: {
		a: v1_0.a
	}
}
-- out/verdict --
# bind
E0367 a in the ForwardLens of v1.0 is v0_0.a * 2, which may be as low as -4294967296, where v1.0 requires >=0
